+# CONTRACT — CLI Time Tracker
+
+- [ ] `start(name)` creates a running entry → test: getEntries() has one entry with stop undefined
+- [ ] `start("")` throws → test: expect throws
+- [ ] `start` while running auto-stops previous → test: previous entry has stop set, new one running
+- [ ] `stop()` sets stop on running entry → test: entry.stop is a number, returns the entry
+- [ ] `stop()` with nothing running throws → test: expect throws
+- [ ] Entry captures task, start, stop → test: shape assertions
+- [ ] Persistence: data written to configurable JSON path → test: new instance reads same entries
+- [ ] Parent dirs auto-created → test: nested path works
+- [ ] getEntries returns all → test: count matches
+- [ ] getEntriesByRange(from,to) filters by start time → test: only in-range returned
+- [ ] getSummary sums ms per task name → test: same name summed
+- [ ] Running tasks use current time in summary → test: summary > 0 for running task
+- [ ] Unicode + emoji task names work → test: round-trip preserves name
+- [ ] `npm run build` clean
+- [ ] `npm run lint` clean
